# Peticiones de ejemplo para el proyecto "Servidor HTTP desde cero"

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"1234"}

### Listar tareas (pegar el token del login)
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks
Authorization: Bearer <pegar-token-aqui>

### Crear tarea
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Authorization: Bearer <pegar-token-aqui>
Content-Type: application/json

{"titulo":"Aprender WebSockets"}

### Obtener una tarea
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer <pegar-token-aqui>

### Actualizar parcialmente
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer <pegar-token-aqui>
Content-Type: application/json

{"hecho": true}

### Borrar
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer <pegar-token-aqui>

### Revalidar con ETag
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks
Authorization: Bearer <pegar-token-aqui>
If-None-Match: "<pegar-etag-aqui>"

### CORS preflight
OPTIONS http://localhost:3000/tasks
Origin: https://app.ejemplo.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
